            "text": "OpenRouter is a consumer/hobbyist multi-model marketplace that incurs a 5.5% credit card deposit surcharge and enforces strict free tier rate limits (50 requests/day). An enterprise-grade LLM gateway like APIVALE provides unthrottled production throughput, native PayPal zero-FX billing, persistent prompt cache hits, and dedicated SLAs for autonomous coding agents."
          }
