          <p>
            When an upstream model provider experiences peak-hour degraded performance or returns <code>HTTP 429 Too Many Requests</code>, autonomous agents (like Claude Code or Cline) fail mid-task. A resilient gateway catches error codes and transparently reroutes requests to hot secondary providers.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pain-card">
          <div class="pain-icon">💸</div>
          <h3>3. Prompt Cache Invalidation & Runaway Costs</h3>
          <p>
            Autonomous coding loops re-send massive file contexts on every tool call. If upstream routing randomly shifts across non-cached cluster nodes, prompt cache hits drop to 0%, quadrupling token expenses. An LLM gateway enforces session affinity to maintain 90% cache discounts.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pain-card">
