            Enterprise teams cannot allow raw developer prompts containing API credentials or customer data to leave their security perimeter unchecked. Modern gateways enforce Zero Data Retention (ZDR) rules and integrate with Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers for auditable tool invocation.
          </p>
